      "serialized_row_index": 54,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "シルバさんが差し出してきた器には、白いシチューが入っている。\n僕は既に昼食を済ませていたが、\n美味しそうな甘い香りに食欲を刺激された。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "14185b03f3bbc5fee250472ad85697183393f012ba632996ac9b18f07052bd52",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふわぁ……おいしそうですね。\nあんまりお腹が空いてないので、\n１杯だけ頂いてもいいですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "8b145e219c1f2366940dbe26fe67381333948bb1f35e70cff00614bee772cb61",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "와아…… 맛있어 보이네요.\n별로 배가 고프지 않으니,\n한 그릇만 먹어도 될까요?",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 56,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
