      "row_index_0based": 55,
      "serialized_row_index": 55,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ふわぁ……おいしそうですね。\nあんまりお腹が空いてないので、\n１杯だけ頂いてもいいですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8a9ef322aafce318b9d990ba2b4f0ae1c068d1041d8299d0c8515960f81cee01",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うむ、もちろん―――だ。\nよく味わって―――食べるんだ―――ぞ。",
      "jp_sha256": "b2546c4e077fd997a1962dc15e84bcb05405b51a4148f699baea2bf2d3a82695",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "음, 물론――― 이다.\n잘 음미해서――― 먹도록――― 해라.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
